    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classSupport" kindref="compound">Support</ref> for initialization of explicit scopes (located only at specific IR nodes). </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This function initializes any uninitialized explicit scope data members. Some IR nodes have explicit scope information where the parent pointer is insufficient to identify the scope because of structural flexability in the layout of the C++ source code. </para>    </detaileddescription>
